  "StockRole": "RISC Missile Boat",
  "YangsThoughts": "The Victor XR was a project by the Republic Institute of Strategic Combat to supersize a Victor and use it as a platform for the newly developed Micro Missile System, their replacement for the MRM. A number of variants were developed, some even including stealth or huge ballistic weapons, but all were based around the same two MMS-40 launchers. All models also share the same 445 Ultralight engine, compact Gyro and Buffered Vehicular DNI Cockpit. Overall the project was deemed a failure, just like the MMS itself, but enough of the 'Mechs were produced that they can still be found throughout the Inner Sphere.",
